# This directory holds the translation-validation simulator's Lean probes:
# the committed regression probes (d3_*.lean) and the scaling benches below.
#
# Generated by pass/lean/Translation_Validation/scripts/d3_gen.py -- deterministic,
# and up to 16 MB each for the `far` shape. d3_bench.sh in that same directory
# writes d3b_*, d3_bench2.sh writes d3c2_*, and so does
# pass/lean/Translation_Validation/tests/d3_bench_generation_controls.sh. The
# generator is committed instead; the timing tables it feeds are run output too,
# ignored in the root .gitignore.
d3b_*.lean
d3c2_*.lean
